CompletableFuture, annotations, lambdas, and virtual threads make the SDK feel like idiomatic Java, not a ported-from-another-language afterthought.Executor integration point.provider/ProviderConfig with your own baseUrl + apiKey (or bearer token). No Copilot subscription required.session.setModel(...) to experiment with different Copilot models.
